    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Substantial 4 Bed Semi-Detached Residence In A Highly Regarded Development \n\nNumber 15 Mountross, New Ross, is a substantial four-bedroom semi-detached residence, ideally located within this highly regarded and peaceful development adjacent to Irishtown and Mountgarrett. Extending to approximately 140 sq. m, the property offers spacious and flexible living accommodation, together with considerable potential for new owners to reimagine the interior and create a wonderful family home. The accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall, living room opening into a sitting room with open fire, sunroom, spacious kitchen/dining room, utility room and a ground-floor bedroom with en-suite shower room. On the first floor, there are three bedrooms and a bathroom. Outside, there is secure off-street parking to the front and a large, sheltered rear garden. Mountross is within a short stroll of several excellent schools, shops and dining options, making it an exceptionally convenient location for family living. Early viewing is advised.\n\nAccommodation\nEntrance Porch 1.9m x 0.9m\n\nEntrance Hall 3.4m x 1.9m\n\nLivingroom 3.9m x 3.4m double doors to \n\nSittingroom 5.9m x 3.3m\n\nKitchen 6.1m x 4.1m\n\nUtility 2m x 1m\n\nBedroom 2.7m x 2.6m plus en-suite shower room 1.9m x 1.6m\n\nFirst floor \n\nBedroom 1. 3.2m x 2.9m\n\nBedroom 2. 3.6m x 2.7m\n\nBedroom 3. 2.8m x 2.3m\n\nBathroom 2.1m x 1.7m \nOUTSIDE: Off street parking to the front, large sheltered south facing garden\nSERVICES: O.F.C.H. all other main services \nBER: D2 No 119275865\nEIRCODE: Y34NF21\nVIEWING: By prior appointment\n\n"
      },
